    "summary": "Paf, the technology partner behind Swiss market leader mycasino.ch, has agreed a pilot with Facebook to stop unlicensed operators reaching Swiss players. Paf will share licence documents and URLs for both operators and affiliates so Meta can tell regulated brands from unregulated ones. Paf's Jesper Eliasson announced the pilot at SBC Summit Lisbon, and work is due to start next week. Mycasino.ch now generates more than €100m a year and holds more than 30% of the Swiss market.",
